autotools: fix link error when system tinyxml is used. (Thanks hesti)

See discussion in C::B forum:
https://forums.codeblocks.org/index.php/topic,26015.msg177209.html

Authored by: christoj 2026-05-26

https://sourceforge.net/p/codeblocks/code/13855/

$ svn diff -r r13854:r13855 > r13855.patch

Patch amended to apply on Gentoo (adds 'a/' and 'b/' prefixes).

This should fix dev-util/codeblocks-25.03 'undefined reference'
